<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C ON KERB AT PLN 13.7.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C ON KERB AT PLN 13.7.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 95,000 shares of Polish paint maker Polifarb Cieszyn at 13.70 zlotys a share was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Polifarb Cieszyn fell 1.4 percent to 13.70 zlotys in a volume of 53,638 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
